47\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/compare/v0.1.1...v0.1.2", "mentions_count": 4}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/releases/248958015", "assets_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/releases/248958015/assets", "upload_url": "https://uploads.github.com/repos/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/releases/248958015/assets{?name,label}", "html_url": "https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/releases/tag/v0.1.1", "id": 248958015, "author": {"login": "Lightblues", "id": 40855072, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQwODU1MDcy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40855072?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues", "html_url": "https://github.com/Lightblues", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Lightblues/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "node_id": "RE_kwDOPhpyqM4O1sw_", "tag_name": "v0.1.1", "target_commitish": "main", "name": "v0.1.1", "draft": false, "immutable": false, "prerelease": false, "created_at": "2025-09-22T08:16:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-22T08:16:31Z", "published_at": "2025-09-22T08:16:31Z", "assets": [], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/tarball/v0.1.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/zipball/v0.1.1", "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* [bugfix] fix cannot load gbk under pwsh by @Mactarvish in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/68\r\n* Add a sidebar for WebUI by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/75\r\n* Fpg2012/issue82 by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/86\r\n* Clear dialog history after switching agent configs by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/87\r\n* fix _edit_memory return value type by @jinghuan-Chen in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/81\r\n* add a search box by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/88\r\n* add support of litellm & azure by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/89\r\n* [bugfix][codec] fix chinese garbled text when saving agent prompt yaml by @Mactarvish in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/90\r\n* improve robustness of Python toolkit by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/95\r\n* [!WIP] i18n support for WebUI by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/97\r\n* Perf/refactor orchestra by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/101\r\n* Lightblues/issue102 feat tool maker by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/104\r\n* Enhance the feature of tool maker by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/111\r\n* Improve error message display by @fpg2012 in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/115\r\n* [typofix] by @Mactarvish in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/116\r\n* Refactor & enhance orchestra agent by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/118\r\n* enhance llm agent by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/youtu-agent/pull/120\r\n* Fix non-stop issue for DataClassWithStreamEvents by @Lightblues in https://github.com/TencentCloudADP/yo